<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>劣质碳水 VS 优质碳水</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'PingFang SC', sans-serif;
            background-color: #e0f7fa;
            background-image: 
                repeating-linear-gradient(to right, transparent, transparent 19px, rgba(0, 128, 0, 0.15) 19px, rgba(0, 128, 0, 0.15) 20px),
                repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, transparent 19px, rgba(0, 128, 0, 0.15) 19px, rgba(0, 128, 0, 0.15) 20px),
                linear-gradient(to bottom, #cceeff 0%, #e6ffcc 30%, #ffeedd 70%, #e6ccff 100%);
            color: #222;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .page-container {
            width: 650px;
            padding: 20px 30px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            background: transparent;
        }
        .main-title {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 3em;
            font-weight: 900;
            font-family: 'Impact', 'Arial Black', sans-serif;
            margin-top: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-shadow: -2px -2px 0 #fff, 2px -2px 0 #fff, -2px 2px 0 #fff, 2px 2px 0 #fff;
        }
        .main-title .bad { color: #000080; }
        .main-title .vs { color: #000080; font-style: italic; margin: 0 5px; font-size: 0.9em; }
        .main-title .good { color: #00aaff; }

        .section {
            margin-bottom: 35px;
        }
        .badge {
            background-color: #e63946;
            color: white;
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 6px 24px;
            border-radius: 25px;
            font-size: 1.3em;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }
        .content-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-start;
        }
        .text-column {
            width: 55%;
            font-size: 1.05em;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        .text-column p {
            margin: 4px 0;
        }
        .text-column .desc {
            margin-top: 10px;
            text-align: justify;
        }
        .image-column {
            width: 42%;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 8px;
            padding-top: 10px;
        }
        .img-placeholder {
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
            border: 1px dashed #888;
            border-radius: 5px;
            aspect-ratio: 1;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 0.7em;
            color: #555;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2px;
        }
        .bottom-notes {
            margin-top: 15px;
            font-size: 1.05em;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .indent-para {
            padding-left: 2em;
            margin: 5px 0;
        }
        .center-subtext {
            text-align: center;
            display: block;
            width: 85%;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page-container">
        <div class="main-title">
            <span class="bad">劣质碳水</span><span class="vs">VS</span><span class="good">优质碳水</span>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <div class="badge">劣质碳水</div>
            <div class="content-row">
                <div class="text-column">
                    <p>·高热量、高糖分</p>
                    <p>·低纤维食物</p>
                    <p>·营养匮乏、高盐</p>
                    <p>·高饱和脂肪、含反式脂肪</p>
                    <div class="desc">
                        经过精加工、纤维含量少的碳水化合物，很容易转换成糖分，因此容易被人体消化吸收、会导致发胖
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="image-column">
                    <div class="img-placeholder placeholder">[Image: Ice Cream]</div>
                    <div class="img-placeholder placeholder">[Image: Fried Dough Balls]</div>
                    <div class="img-placeholder placeholder">[Image: Cake Slice]</div>
                    <div class="img-placeholder placeholder">[Image: French Fries]</div>
                    <div class="img-placeholder placeholder">[Image: Potato Chips]</div>
                    <div class="img-placeholder placeholder">[Image: Spicy Hot Pot]</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bottom-notes">
                <div class="indent-para">
                    比如：炸薯条、油条、薯片、油煎饼、酸辣粉、麻球、饼干、披萨饼、冰淇淋、糖果、马卡龙、奶油蛋糕...
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <div class="badge">优质碳水</div>
            <div class="content-row">
                <div class="text-column">
                    <p>·低热量、低糖分</p>
                    <p>·高纤维食物</p>
                    <p>·营养丰富、低盐</p>
                    <p>·低饱和脂肪、无反式脂肪</p>
                    <div class="desc">
                        优质的碳水化合物又称慢碳水化合物，通常是指没有经过加工的、完整的碳水化合物，在人体内消化时间较长，延长饱腹感的同时，不会使血糖突然飙升。
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="image-column">
                    <div class="img-placeholder placeholder">[Image: Bowl of Oats]</div>
                    <div class="img-placeholder placeholder">[Image: Bowl of Quinoa]</div>
                    <div class="img-placeholder placeholder">[Image: Bowl of Brown Rice]</div>
                    <div class="img-placeholder placeholder">[Image: Sweet Potatoes]</div>
                    <div class="img-placeholder placeholder">[Image: Taro]</div>
                    <div class="img-placeholder placeholder">[Image: Yam]</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bottom-notes">
                <div class="indent-para">
                    谷类：主要来自于粮食，如荞麦、燕麦、糙米、紫米、薏米等（谷类
                    <span class="center-subtext">中含有的是多糖的淀粉，不会造成血糖迅速地</span>
                    <span class="center-subtext">升高）</span>
                </div>
                <div class="indent-para">
                    薯类：主要是红薯、番薯、芋头、山药等。
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
```
